          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem landau (hf : Differentiable ℂ f) (hfc : f c ≠ 0) (hR : 0 < R) {B : ℝ}\n    (hB : ∀ z ∈ closedBall c R, ‖f z‖ ≤ B) (hBc : ‖f c‖ < B) {z : ℂ} (hz : z ∈ closedBall c (R / 4))\n    (hfz : f z ≠ 0) :\n    ‖logDeriv f z - ∑ u ∈ zerosIn f c R (R / 2), ((divB f c R u).toNat : ℂ) / (z - u)‖ ≤\n      48 * Real.log (B / ‖f c‖) / R :=",
